sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant S as Trusted surface
    participant M as Mandate service<br/>ap2_authorize
    participant P as Verifier
    V->>S: sets spending cap + approves quote
    S->>M: mint intent mandate
    M-->>S: signed JWT (cap, expiry)
    S->>M: mint cart mandate (exact total)
    M-->>S: signed JWT (chained hash)
    S->>P: verify chain
    P-->>S: chain valid: authorized
    S-->>V: verifiable receipt
